# Wayne's World: boot toward the title, then press Start.
#
# Timings are a first-pass seed, not a proven route through every intro.
#   ./build/WaynesWorldSNESRecomp "<rom>" --script scripts/routes/gameplay.script
#
# `turbo on` changes presentation pacing only (no guest frames are added).
turbo on
wait 3600
press start 4
wait 3600
quit
